<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka stock market closed for holidays.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka stock market closed for holidays.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's stock market was closed on Thursday for the Christmas break.</p>
<p>On Monday, the last trading day, the all share ended 1.2 points lower at 595.8 on turnover of 16.1 million rupees.</p>
<p>Trading resumes on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (41) 4534319</p>
